=== CONTROLLED CONFIRMATION: THE FABRIC RING OSCILLATOR DOES NOT OSCILLATE ON THE AX7203 ===
Date: 2026-11-22 ~12:05 UTC+7
Host: macOS, Digilent HS2 (FT232H 0x0403:0x6014), busdev 1:3

THE CONTROLLED PAIR. The two probes are byte-for-byte the same design except for ONE line:
the clock source. Prescaler, ripple counter, BSCANE2 USER1 readback and register layout are
identical, so any difference in behaviour is attributable to the clock source.

  clock_probe_ring.bit  md5 35c167a1a58015286a58b98e33fb9b9c   (20-stage fabric ring oscillator)
  clock_probe_cfg.bit   md5 22834ed68c001f05c50c7c00479bc437   (STARTUPE2.CFGMCLK)

--- RING OSCILLATOR, 30 READS OVER ~15 s ---
  read  1: raw=0xA5A00000 magic=OK count=0
  read  2: raw=0xA5A00000 magic=OK count=0
  read  3: raw=0xA5A00000 magic=OK count=0
