  read  7: raw=0xA5A00000 magic=OK count=0
  read  8: raw=0xA5A00000 magic=OK count=0
  read  9: raw=0xA5A00000 magic=OK count=0
  read 10: raw=0xA5A00000 magic=OK count=0
  ... (reads 11-30 identical)
  --- 30/30 reads carried the magic ---
  NO USABLE DELTAS
  distinct counter values observed across 30 reads: count=0

  The magic comes back correctly on every read, so the JTAG readback path works and the design
  is loaded and running its readback logic. The counter itself never moved.

